description: Required review report format for ExtensionFixes tasks
globs:
  - "**/*"
alwaysApply: true
---

# ExtensionFixes Review Rules

After every task, output:

1. Modified files
2. Added URLs
3. Architecture compliance
4. SEO compliance
5. Content safety check
6. Search/sitemap check
7. npm run lint result
8. npm run build result
9. npm run review result
10. Deploy recommendation

If any rule conflicts with the task, stop and explain the conflict.
